,title,link,text,language,family
0,Chitkuli Kinnauri language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chitkuli_Kinnauri_language,"Chitkuli Kinnauri, also known as Chhitkul-Rakchham, is a language spoken in Kinnaur district of Himachal Pradesh, India. It is spoken in two villages in the Sangla division of Kinnaur – specifically in the villages of Chitkul and Rakchham.","Kinnauri, Chitkuli",Sino-Tibetan
1,Kinnauri language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kinnauri_language,"Chitkuli Kinnauri is spoken by a thousand people in the Baspa river area of the Sangla valley in Nichar subdivision, Kinnaur district, Himachal Pradesh (in Chitkul and Rakchham villages).","Kinnauri, Chitkuli",Sino-Tibetan
2,Chitkuli Kinnauri language,https://grokipedia.com/page/chitkuli_kinnauri_language,"Chitkuli Kinnauri exhibits lexical similarities with other Kinnauri dialects that position it as an intermediate variety between the Sangla and Nako groups, though it forms a distinct branch within the overall Kinnauri dialect cluster.","Kinnauri, Chitkuli",Sino-Tibetan
3,"Kinnauri, Chitkuli language. Evangelism tools, church planting...",https://globalrecordings.net/en/language/cik,"Download Kinnauri Chitkuli - The Two Roads.mp3. Audio recordings available in Kinnauri, Chitkuli. These recordings are designed for evangelism and basic Bible teaching to bring the gospel message to people who are not literate or are from oral cultures, particularly unreached people groups.","Kinnauri, Chitkuli",Sino-Tibetan
4,Kinnauri songs - YouTube Music,https://music.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL1DUdJIYlh6xuyGKvUvrfFPx-8U1r6BCy,"Listen to Kinnauri songs on YouTube Music - a dedicated music app with official songs, music videos, remixes, covers, and more.","Kinnauri, Chitkuli",Sino-Tibetan
5,"KHAGO CHU CHITKUL I KINNAURI TRADITIONAL SONG I SUBHAN NEGI I ...Kinnauri language - WikipediaChitkuli Kinnauri language - grokipedia.comK i n n au r i l an gu age - Internet ArchiveKinnauri, Chitkuli language - Global Recordings Network",https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Av1NNY0JLoA,"KHAGO CHU CHITKUL CREDITS VOCALS: SUBHAN NEGI MUSIC: GIAN NEGI LYRICS: TRADITIONAL VIDEO: ADARSH NEGI BACKGROUND VIDEO CREDITS: • Kinnauri Cinematic Video (Shukud) Vatsal ... • Shukud... Chitkuli Kinnauri is spoken by a thousand people in the Baspa river area of the Sangla valley in Nichar subdivision, Kinnaur district, Himachal Pradesh (in Chitkul and Rakchham villages). Chitkuli Kinnauri is classified as a Sino-Tibetan language belonging to the Tibeto-Burman branch, more specifically within the Himalayish subgroup under West Himalayish and then Kanauri (also known as Kinnauri). Jul 25, 2020 · Chitkuli Kinnauri is spoken by a thousand people in the Baspa river area of the Sangla valley in Nichar subdivision, Kinnaur district, Himachal Pradesh (in Chitkul and Rakchham villages). Audio recordings available in Kinnauri, Chitkuli These recordings are designed for evangelism and basic Bible teaching to bring the gospel message to people who are not literate or are from oral cultures, particularly unreached people groups.","Kinnauri, Chitkuli",Sino-Tibetan
