8,"Appendix:Lahauli Spiti Kinnauri Swadesh lists - Wiktionary, the free...",https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Appendix:Lahauli_Spiti_Kinnauri_Swadesh_lists,"This is a Swadesh list of Sino-Tibetan languages, specifically Ladakhi, Balti, Purik, Pattani, Kinnauri, Chitkuli Kinnauri, Bhoti Kinnauri, Kanashi, Spiti Bhoti, Stod Bhoti, Gahri, Tinani, Jad, Rongpo, Darmiya, Byangsi and Chaudangsi, compared with that of English.","Kinnauri, Chitkuli",Sino-Tibetan
